    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26342" root="طبق" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَبْقٌ</span></b> : see an ex. of the accus. case, in the
phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَلَدَتِ الغَنَمُ طَبْقًا</span>, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَبَقٌ</span>, last quarter. ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَبْقٌ</span> is also expl., by IAar, as meaning The
<i>doing wrong,</i> or <i>injuring, by false pretence</i> or <i>false
allegation.</i> (TA.)

